    "body": "It is set to \"`webtransport`\" [in the WT constructor](https://w3c.github.io/webtransport/#pseudo-header) so that is the only possible value rn and is valid for H2. But H3 is not a precondition at that point, hence the need for code here. I'll add a note to clarify this.",
